# Shared Embedding Service — HTTP test file
# Run the server first:  uvicorn main:app --reload
#
# Replace <YOUR_API_KEY> with the key returned by /apps/register.

### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Accept: application/json

###

### 1. Register a new app (run once per app — save the returned api_key)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/apps/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "my-app"
}

###

### 2. Get info about the authenticated app
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/apps/me
X-API-Key: <YOUR_API_KEY>

###

### 3. Generate raw embeddings (used by RemoteEmbeddingFunction in client apps)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/embed
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: <YOUR_API_KEY>

{
  "texts": ["Hello world", "How are you?"]
}

###

### 4. Create a collection
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/collections
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: <YOUR_API_KEY>

{
  "name": "docs"
}

###

### 5. List collections
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/collections
X-API-Key: <YOUR_API_KEY>

###

### 6. Add documents (embeddings are generated automatically on the service)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/collections/docs/documents
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: <YOUR_API_KEY>

{
  "documents": [
    "FastAPI is a modern Python web framework.",
    "ChromaDB is an open-source vector database.",
    "Sentence transformers produce dense vector embeddings."
  ],
  "ids": ["doc1", "doc2", "doc3"],
  "metadatas": [
    {"source": "web"},
    {"source": "web"},
    {"source": "paper"}
  ]
}

###

### 7. Query — semantic search
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/collections/docs/query
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: <YOUR_API_KEY>

{
  "query_texts": ["What is a vector database?"],
  "n_results": 2
}

###

### 8. Get documents (paginated)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/collections/docs/documents?limit=10&offset=0
X-API-Key: <YOUR_API_KEY>

###

### 9. Upsert documents (add if new, overwrite if existing)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/collections/docs/documents
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: <YOUR_API_KEY>

{
  "documents": ["FastAPI is a high-performance Python web framework built on Starlette."],
  "ids": ["doc1"]
}

###

### 10. Delete specific documents
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/collections/docs/documents
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: <YOUR_API_KEY>

{
  "ids": ["doc3"]
}

###

### 11. Delete an entire collection
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/collections/docs
X-API-Key: <YOUR_API_KEY>

###
